    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;TATARIME&quot; is a cooperative multiplayer horror game for up to four players.<br>Enter a cursed village and take on the dangerous task of recovering haunted artifacts.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Explore a Village Shrouded in Darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange entities roam the village under the cover of night.<br>Stay out of sight and carefully make your way through the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Recover Cursed Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items are sealed with powerful curses\u2014and touching them may unleash something terrible.<br>Feel the tension rise with every step as you search for what you were sent to find.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Work Together to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with up to four players.<br>Communicate, divide tasks, and complete the mission efficiently\u2014or not.<br>Will you help your teammates... or leave them behind?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;TATARIME&quot; is a cooperative multiplayer horror game for up to four players.<br>Enter a cursed village and take on the dangerous task of recovering haunted artifacts.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Explore a Village Shrouded in Darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange entities roam the village under the cover of night.<br>Stay out of sight and carefully make your way through the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Recover Cursed Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items are sealed with powerful curses\u2014and touching them may unleash something terrible.<br>Feel the tension rise with every step as you search for what you were sent to find.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Work Together to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with up to four players.<br>Communicate, divide tasks, and complete the mission efficiently\u2014or not.<br>Will you help your teammates... or leave them behind?</p>",
